        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Length of resist-dyed and embroidered hemp, Japan, 19th century"@en , "Length of fine hemp cloth, Kaga Yuzen on Asa, stencilled and  embroidered with silk and golden gilt threads. The silk embroidery has later been removed leaving only that in gold braid.\nThe design shows umbrellas and flower branches in blue, red, pink, grey, yellow and green."@en ;
